        "headline": "Economic Policy corrected from D to C",
        "body": "The published action count already had one executing lever and one authorized lever, which contradicted the prior D condition of fewer than two. This is a rule-application correction, not evidence of improvement. Business investment has fallen for five straight quarters, so the trend remains declining.",
